{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_scaffold",
      "label": "Scaffold (Produto CONTRATAR)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Ado\u00e7\u00e3o em trilhas guiadas, quatro fases, gates bloqueantes. \"O que foi prometido?\" \u2014 job \u00e9 levar um processo do piloto \u00e0 pr\u00e1tica permanente e sair rodando sem a Nebuloz."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_trilha",
      "label": "Trilha (Track, c\u00f3digo TR-)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Leva um processo por Assess \u2192 Pilot \u2192 Scale \u2192 Embed (Avaliar, Pilotar, Escalar, Incorporar); cada fase tem passos com artefato esperado e fecha num gate com crit\u00e9rios."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_caso_de_negocio",
      "label": "Caso de Neg\u00f3cio (Business Case, c\u00f3digo BC-)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "A promessa assinada da trilha: N m\u00e9tricas, dire\u00e7\u00e3o, confian\u00e7a, benef\u00edcio hard ou soft; versionado, imut\u00e1vel ao assinar \u2014 mudar \u00e9 nova vers\u00e3o com justificativa; entidade que o Scaffold possui no mapa de fronteiras."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_gate_bloqueante",
      "label": "Gate Bloqueante (Product Principle 1)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "\"O comportamento bloqueante do gate \u00e9 o produto\": fechar fase sem crit\u00e9rios atendidos ou override atribu\u00eddo \u00e9 defeito de severidade m\u00e1xima; risco n\u00ba1 \u00e9 o gate virar \"formalidade que todo mundo waiva\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_override",
      "label": "Override (Decis\u00e3o Registrada, Product Principle 2)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Override \u00e9 decis\u00e3o com autor, crit\u00e9rios dispensados e justificativa, gravada para sempre; baseline assinado e pol\u00edtica do Charter n\u00e3o admitem override. S\u00f3 o Consultor Nebuloz tem essa permiss\u00e3o."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_sem_a_gente",
      "label": "\"Sem a Gente\" (Product Principle 3, Observa\u00e7\u00e3o de 30 Dias)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Crit\u00e9rio verific\u00e1vel, n\u00e3o slogan: \u00faltimo crit\u00e9rio do Embed \u00e9 \"Processo sobrevive 30 dias sem envolvimento da Nebuloz\", e reabrir invalida a janela de observa\u00e7\u00e3o."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_baseline_caso_ownership",
      "label": "Posse de Baseline e Caso de Neg\u00f3cio (Mapa de Fronteiras)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Scaffold \u00e9 dono de baseline e caso de neg\u00f3cio (linha de base, meta, janela, assinatura) \u2014 costura cr\u00edtica com o Signal, que apura contra ele e nunca o edita. Tamb\u00e9m dono de engajamento, fase e gate (Cosmos e back-office leem)."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_gate_types_trio",
      "label": "Tr\u00eas Gates, Tr\u00eas Donos (Fase / Ciclo de Vida / Pol\u00edtica)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Gate de fase (Scaffold), gate de ciclo de vida (Cosmos) e gate de pol\u00edtica (Charter) s\u00e3o tr\u00eas coisas com tr\u00eas donos distintos no mapa de fronteiras."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_p0_membership_blocker",
      "label": "Bloqueio P0: ScaffoldMembership Nunca Gravado",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Nada grava ScaffoldMembership (sem bootstrap, tela ou seed); a recusa manda \"pedir a um consultor\" que n\u00e3o tem onde atribuir \u2014 ningu\u00e9m entra no produto."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_p0_fase1_blocker",
      "label": "Bloqueio P0: Fase 1 Nunca Fecha [inferido]",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Nenhuma a\u00e7\u00e3o cria o caso de neg\u00f3cio nem edita m\u00e9tricas, e o gate de baseline n\u00e3o admite override \u2014 a Fase Assess n\u00e3o tem caminho de fechamento."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_adr_0014",
      "label": "ADR-0014 (Promo\u00e7\u00e3o vira Engagement no Back-office)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Status \"Accepted\", mas conflitante: a ADR-0014 e o Engagement do back-office disputam a entidade engajamento, que o mapa de fronteiras d\u00e1 ao Scaffold."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_adr_0015",
      "label": "ADR-0015 (Caso de Neg\u00f3cio Versionado)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Decis\u00e3o registrada que fundamenta o caso de neg\u00f3cio como versionado, com hash e confian\u00e7a por m\u00e9trica."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_adr_0016",
      "label": "ADR-0016 (Resid\u00eancia de Dado Fora do V1)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "\"Um cliente que exija resid\u00eancia de dado hoje n\u00e3o \u00e9 atend\u00edvel\"; tamb\u00e9m fundamenta que nenhuma promessa parcial aparece na UI."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_adr_0017",
      "label": "ADR-0017 (Fila de Gates no Back-office)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Fundamenta a Fila de gates do back-office, que agrupa a carteira por Aguardando decis\u00e3o, Bloqueado e Em observa\u00e7\u00e3o."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_fila_de_gates",
      "label": "Fila de Gates (Back-office)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Agrupa \"Aguardando decis\u00e3o\", \"Bloqueado\" e \"Em observa\u00e7\u00e3o\" de toda a carteira; \"Entrar no cliente\" exige motivo de 12+ caracteres e grava AccessLog."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_role_matrix",
      "label": "Matriz de Pap\u00e9is do Scaffold (scaffold-matrix.ts)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Sem coringa, admin do tenant n\u00e3o herda: Membro do time executa passos; Dono do processo fecha gate e assina/contesta, nunca faz override; L\u00edder de transforma\u00e7\u00e3o conduz e redige; Consultor Nebuloz \u00e9 o \u00fanico com override; Administrador n\u00e3o fecha gate nem assina."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_pacote_passagem_bastao",
      "label": "Pacote de Passagem de Bast\u00e3o",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "ZIP com HTML offline, leg\u00edvel sem conta (SC-006), sa\u00edda do Embed; nome de marca fixo no site (handover pack)."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_metodos_semeados",
      "label": "M\u00e9todos Semeados (Templates)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "\"Triagem de suporte\", \"Revis\u00e3o de documentos\" e \"Relat\u00f3rios\" (6 vers\u00f5es), que s\u00f3 entram por seed (packages/database/scripts/scaffold-templates.ts); autores fict\u00edcios de prot\u00f3tipo."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_signal_export_contract",
      "label": "Export <c\u00f3digo>-signal-v2.json (nebuloz.signal.baseline/2)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Sa\u00edda do Embed junto ao pacote offline; shape v2 sem consumidor \u2014 o Signal n\u00e3o importa esse contrato, ent\u00e3o a costura cr\u00edtica do mapa de fronteiras n\u00e3o existe."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_metodo_como_dado",
      "label": "M\u00e9todo Como Dado Versionado (Product Principle 5)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Vers\u00e3o do m\u00e9todo \u00e9 imut\u00e1vel e pinada por trilha; customiza\u00e7\u00e3o do cliente \u00e9 conjunto de opera\u00e7\u00f5es que sobrevive ao upgrade ou vira conflito expl\u00edcito; customiza\u00e7\u00e3o nunca sobrescreve em sil\u00eancio."
    },
    {
      "id": "apps_app_components_scaffold_product_engagement_entity_conflict",
      "label": "Conflito da Entidade Engajamento (ADR-0014 vs Back-office)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "apps/app/components/scaffold/PRODUCT.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Gap com o mapa: a ADR-0014 (promo\u00e7\u00e3o vira Engagement no back-office) e o Engagement do back-office disputam a entidade que o mapa d\u00e1 ao Scaffold; decis\u00e3o em aberto se a ADR-0014 passa a Superseded."
    }
